<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>CineTube - Email Verification</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #0f0f0f; color: #f0f0f0; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 520px; margin: 40px auto; background: #1a1a2e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
    .logo { text-align: center; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #e94560; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    h2 { color: #ffffff; text-align: center; }
    p { color: #cccccc; line-height: 1.6; }
    .otp-box { background: #16213e; border: 2px solid #e94560; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;
                text-align: center; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 10px;
                color: #e94560; margin: 24px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 32px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo">🎬 CineTube</div>
    <h2>Your Verification Code</h2>
    <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Use the OTP below to verify your email address. This code is valid for <strong>2 minutes</strong>.</p>
    <div class="otp-box"><%= otp %></div>
    <p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> CineTube. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
